      "statement": "calculateElo computes expected score as 1/(1+10^((opponent-player)/400)), delta as kFactor*(actualScore-expectedScore), and a new rating that is rounded and clamped up to a rating floor of 100; the returned delta is the effective change after clamping, so a player at the floor who loses records a delta of 0.",
